  "description": "§4.9 (TS40): the state-2 entry reset zeroes the five fields of every working row and sets the separate per-slot comparison value to -1.0. First pass: an Avenue (6) car record at (5, 1) with inv_cap 1.0 and volume 0.5 publishes (0.5, 0, 5, 1, 0.5). Entering 2 again: the working rows are zeros, the 14 comparison values -1.0. Second pass with volume NaN: the ratio NaN never beats -1.0 (ordered compare) and is not > 1.0, so the Avenue row publishes (NaN, 0, 0, 0, 0.0): sum NaN / 1 = NaN, max fields 0, not -1.0; its record count is 1. Empty slots publish zeros.",
